{"author":"Rebar Bot","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation committed locally as 625c29df20f, in worktree `rt-transient-retry` at origin/main dcb35ce77fe. `make verify` is running before the push.\n\nRed then green:\n- `tests/unit/reconciler/mutate/test_coordinator_transient_http_retry.py` was added first, with the clock seam patched `raising=False`, and run against unchanged dcb35ce77fe. 6 of 8 failed: the 4 parametrized 429/500/502/503-then-success cases, the Retry-After lower-bound case, and the exhaustion case. The 2 cases that pin unchanged behavior passed: a non-429 4xx fails at once, and a Retry-After above the cap raises without sleeping.\n- With the change, all 8 pass.\n\nLayout change from the first plan. Adding the 2 helpers to `batch_dispatch.py` would have taken it to about 825 lines, over the 800-line cap. So the helpers sit in the modules that already own their concerns:\n- `retry_budget.TransientRetryBudget` and `transient_budget_factory`;\n- `failure_policy.classify_http_exception`, a pure leaf that returns `(signal_status, scope, provider_delay_ms)`.\n\n`batch_dispatch.py` is now 785 lines. The plan text and file impact are updated to this layout (9 paths, matching the diff exactly), and the plan is being re-reviewed.\n\nThe 2 S7-era tests are updated:\n- `test_transient_503_on_update_is_retried_by_the_coordinator_budget`, which replaces the 503-once test, asserts 2 calls, 1 applied outcome and 1 budget sleep of at least 2000 ms, and fails if anything really sleeps.\n- `test_live_reroute_reraises_non_404_httperror_fail_fast`: a 500 on every call through `applier.apply` makes 3 calls, then the original error propagates.\n\nChecks: `make lint` and `make typecheck` exit 0; complexity `new=0 increased=0`; mechanism `increased=0`, with no new mechanism added."},"env_id":"eea68b7f-6697-488b-ac52-744e2ed8e96f","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1792719169423619319,"uuid":"b8b81487-77a3-4ab9-a9f1-ebc060e8a1bc"}